WEBVTT

1
00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:51.292
<i>Year 2009, Sri Lanka.</i>

2
00:01:51.583 --> 00:01:54.208
<i>Jaffna territory, Mangoose Jungle.</i>

3
00:01:56.458 --> 00:02:00.417
<i>Forty-eight hours after the extermination
of the Sri Lankan Tigers,</i>

4
00:02:01.375 --> 00:02:05.500
<i>the Sri Lankan Army entered
the dense forest of Jaffna.</i>

5
00:02:06.792 --> 00:02:08.958
<i>The Tigers' reign of terror had ended.</i>

6
00:02:09.458 --> 00:02:12.667
<i>But death still lurked
at every step in the forest.</i>

7
00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:16.583
<i>Though their empire
had stretched across the land,</i>

8
00:02:18.667 --> 00:02:21.667
<i>its roots reached deep
into the halls of hell.</i>

9
00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.292
<i>With the help of the local villagers,</i>

10
00:02:26.375 --> 00:02:30.333
<i>the Sri Lankan Army started
excavating the forest</i>

11
00:02:30.458 --> 00:02:35.000
<i>in search of hidden weapons and treasure.</i>

12
00:03:11.917 --> 00:03:12.917
What was that?

13
00:04:01.083 --> 00:04:03.208
<i>Anna,</i> military.

14
00:04:03.875 --> 00:04:05.750
Do you want to toil your entire life away?

15
00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:23.000
All boys, alert!

16
00:04:35.125 --> 00:04:36.208
Somu!

17
00:05:29.458 --> 00:05:30.458
<i>Anna!</i>

18
00:05:31.708 --> 00:05:32.708
Selva!

19
00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:13.000
Come on!

20
00:07:28.042 --> 00:07:29.208
Who are you people?

21
00:07:47.958 --> 00:07:49.708
Answer me, you punks!

22
00:07:50.292 --> 00:07:51.292
Where are you from?

23
00:07:55.167 --> 00:07:56.167
Burma?

24
00:07:57.500 --> 00:07:58.583
Bangladesh?

25
00:08:00.292 --> 00:08:02.000
Or from Pakistan?

26
00:08:02.667 --> 00:08:04.875
Are you terrorists or smugglers?

27
00:08:06.958 --> 00:08:09.292
These guys look well-trained.
They won't talk.

28
00:08:09.792 --> 00:08:12.708
Charge them with every unresolved case.

29
00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:13.875
Alright, sir.

30
00:08:13.958 --> 00:08:14.833
Get the files.

31
00:08:14.917 --> 00:08:15.917
Sri Lanka.

32
00:08:17.292 --> 00:08:18.292
Sri Lanka?

33
00:08:18.917 --> 00:08:20.833
- Tigers?
- Porter.

34
00:08:21.375 --> 00:08:23.958
A porter?
What exactly are you here to carry?

35
00:08:25.375 --> 00:08:26.375
Sir.

36
00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:28.292
The militants

37
00:08:28.583 --> 00:08:30.125
burned down our entire village, sir.

38
00:08:31.708 --> 00:08:34.833
There's nothing left for us to survive on.

39
00:08:35.875 --> 00:08:38.125
We came here seeking shelter.

40
00:08:38.458 --> 00:08:41.059
Do you think seeking shelter
is as easy as asking for a cigarette?

41
00:08:43.708 --> 00:08:44.833
You're seeking shelter.

42
00:08:46.917 --> 00:08:48.875
You need an ID.
There are rules and regulations.

43
00:09:02.958 --> 00:09:03.958
Gold!

44
00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:09.375
This should be enough for entry.

45
00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:11.583
And for identity proof?

46
00:09:14.083 --> 00:09:15.417
Sir, that's a lot of gold!

47
00:09:28.583 --> 00:09:29.583
Sir…

48
00:09:33.417 --> 00:09:35.458
I'm risking a lot for these bricks.

49
00:09:36.125 --> 00:09:37.417
Be careful.

50
00:09:37.875 --> 00:09:39.917
Are we changing only the address,
or the names too?

51
00:09:40.292 --> 00:09:42.292
I'm really fond of my name.

52
00:09:42.667 --> 00:09:43.667
And that is?

53
00:09:46.167 --> 00:09:47.333
Ranatunga.

54
00:10:21.625 --> 00:10:23.125
This is the parcel, Madam President.

55
00:10:44.625 --> 00:10:46.625
<i>To the Honorable President,</i>

56
00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:49.708
<i>I'm writing this letter from Motupalli,</i>

57
00:10:49.958 --> 00:10:54.250
<i>a small village in the Prakasam district
of Andhra Pradesh.</i>

58
00:10:54.458 --> 00:10:56.458
<i>The hands writing this letter
may be small,</i>

59
00:10:56.625 --> 00:10:58.333
<i>but the issue at hand is big.</i>

60
00:10:58.542 --> 00:11:02.458
<i>My brothers have sent you
their severed fingers.</i>

61
00:11:02.542 --> 00:11:06.292
<i>If you don't help us within 24 hours,</i>

62
00:11:06.375 --> 00:11:08.750
<i>know that only our severed fingers
have arrived this time.</i>

63
00:11:08.833 --> 00:11:12.167
<i>Next time,
you'll receive our severed heads.</i>

64
00:11:18.792 --> 00:11:21.083
Call CBI Officer Satya Murthy right now.

65
00:11:21.833 --> 00:11:22.833
Immediately!

66
00:11:25.042 --> 00:11:26.042
<i>Jai Hind,</i> sir.

67
00:11:30.417 --> 00:11:31.417
<i>Jai Hind,</i> ma'am.

68
00:11:55.458 --> 00:11:57.833
I can hear that child's voice.

69
00:11:59.042 --> 00:12:01.667
I can see that kid's pain before my eyes.

70
00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:05.375
We have to do something, Satya Murthy.

71
00:12:05.792 --> 00:12:07.167
This is a sensitive issue, ma'am.

72
00:12:08.125 --> 00:12:09.625
Before we take any action,

73
00:12:10.292 --> 00:12:12.250
we need to understand what happened there.

74
00:12:15.292 --> 00:12:19.000
We often claim
to have made global progress,

75
00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:22.250
but people still have to go
to extreme lengths for justice.

76
00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:24.333
It's not fair, Satya Murthy.

77
00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:26.042
It's my order.

78
00:12:27.417 --> 00:12:29.083
You must go to Motupalli

79
00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.361
and gather all the information
about what's happening there.

80
00:12:32.708 --> 00:12:34.792
And keep me updated constantly.

81
00:12:35.292 --> 00:12:37.375
I'm giving you
all the special permissions.

82
00:12:37.833 --> 00:12:39.875
- Start immediately.
- Yes, ma'am.

83
00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:41.500
<i>Jai Hind!</i>

84
00:12:47.458 --> 00:12:48.458
Listen.

85
00:12:49.083 --> 00:12:50.542
By the time I reach Hyderabad,

86
00:12:50.958 --> 00:12:53.667
tell all the senior officials
of the Revenue Department

87
00:12:53.875 --> 00:12:57.458
and a police officer who knows
everything about the place

88
00:12:57.625 --> 00:12:58.708
to come to the airport.

89
00:12:59.208 --> 00:13:01.542
And keep this extremely confidential.

90
00:13:02.375 --> 00:13:03.375
Yes, sir.

91
00:13:49.375 --> 00:13:51.208
This is Kishan!

92
00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:53.708
Kishan!

93
00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:00.583
We didn't listen when he told us to leave.

94
00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:04.000
Hey, there's another person here.

95
00:14:05.958 --> 00:14:07.000
Look!

96
00:15:07.208 --> 00:15:09.958
VILLAGE COUNCIL OFFICE
MOTUPALLI

97
00:15:19.042 --> 00:15:23.208
FISHERMEN'S COLONY

98
00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:27.625
These bodies were found in a field
on the outskirts of the village.

99
00:15:28.583 --> 00:15:30.750
But no one is speaking up.

100
00:15:47.708 --> 00:15:48.708
<i>Anna!</i>

101
00:15:54.042 --> 00:15:55.242
What happened in this village?

102
00:15:58.625 --> 00:15:59.708
Will someone tell me?

103
00:16:02.333 --> 00:16:03.583
Who did this?

104
00:16:15.125 --> 00:16:16.125
<i>Amma.</i>

105
00:16:17.875 --> 00:16:19.833
I know you're scared to tell the truth.

106
00:16:21.083 --> 00:16:24.083
But your tears scream
that they were your loved ones.

107
00:16:26.292 --> 00:16:27.292
Speak up.

108
00:16:27.375 --> 00:16:29.750
No one is going to talk!

109
00:16:33.750 --> 00:16:34.750
Hey!

110
00:16:34.958 --> 00:16:37.042
These are the dead.

111
00:16:38.375 --> 00:16:40.875
And those who remain are the living dead.

112
00:16:43.042 --> 00:16:47.708
These people sacrificed their lives
to uplift all of you.

113
00:16:48.292 --> 00:16:50.458
And these people…

114
00:16:52.625 --> 00:16:57.417
They repay them by acting like strangers.

115
00:16:57.667 --> 00:16:58.667
Why?

116
00:16:59.583 --> 00:17:01.625
Because this village…

117
00:17:03.042 --> 00:17:04.250
Is not a village.

118
00:17:05.542 --> 00:17:07.417
It is a cremation ground.

119
00:17:08.917 --> 00:17:12.250
And everything is burned to ashes
in this godforsaken place.

120
00:17:14.667 --> 00:17:16.625
Burned. Reduced to ashes.

121
00:17:19.458 --> 00:17:22.000
Look. Look here.

122
00:17:22.208 --> 00:17:23.208
Have a look.

123
00:17:23.708 --> 00:17:24.708
Just look.

124
00:17:25.333 --> 00:17:26.958
Look at these hands.

125
00:17:29.208 --> 00:17:31.500
He has no one here.

126
00:17:32.458 --> 00:17:33.625
A <i>rakhi?</i>

127
00:17:35.042 --> 00:17:36.083
Look.

128
00:17:36.417 --> 00:17:39.583
Even in death, this hand is pointing

129
00:17:40.458 --> 00:17:42.375
to the one who tied that <i>rakhi.</i>

130
00:17:43.833 --> 00:17:45.167
Brother!

131
00:17:47.833 --> 00:17:49.333
Now the sister has woken up!

132
00:17:51.542 --> 00:17:52.625
My son!

133
00:17:52.708 --> 00:17:54.750
Here comes the mother!

134
00:17:56.958 --> 00:17:57.958
The father.

135
00:18:00.667 --> 00:18:02.292
Now… Hey!

136
00:18:07.417 --> 00:18:08.750
<i>Now</i> you recognize him!

137
00:18:11.167 --> 00:18:12.458
Everyone is crying now.

138
00:18:14.875 --> 00:18:16.042
At least tell me now!

139
00:18:17.667 --> 00:18:19.292
Tell me who did this!

140
00:18:20.208 --> 00:18:21.625
Ranatunga!

141
00:18:50.333 --> 00:18:51.875
We can't do this…

142
00:18:52.083 --> 00:18:53.250
Screw you!

143
00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:00.750
Look.

144
00:19:01.792 --> 00:19:07.083
One of my sons thinks
before raising his hand.

145
00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:12.375
But the other one, Somulu,
doesn't think at all.

146
00:19:13.708 --> 00:19:15.375
Do what you've been told

147
00:19:15.667 --> 00:19:17.458
before he gets here.

148
00:19:21.875 --> 00:19:24.042
<i>Amma,</i> but it's a Sunday.

149
00:19:25.083 --> 00:19:26.083
So?

150
00:19:27.250 --> 00:19:28.917
Don't you eat on Sundays?

151
00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:30.581
Don't you drink on Sundays?

152
00:19:36.083 --> 00:19:38.917
Write tomorrow's date and sign.

153
00:19:39.833 --> 00:19:40.875
<i>- Amma...</i>
- Come on!

154
00:19:43.083 --> 00:19:44.083
Do it!

155
00:19:47.375 --> 00:19:49.417
Duty and warrant?
Those are some big words.

156
00:19:49.875 --> 00:19:50.958
Who do you want to arrest?

157
00:19:51.167 --> 00:19:52.167
Ranatunga!

158
00:19:52.333 --> 00:19:53.333
Ranatunga?!

159
00:19:55.042 --> 00:19:57.667
Looks like you haven't heard
that name before.

160
00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:00.375
Before it becomes
the last name you'll ever hear,

161
00:20:00.458 --> 00:20:03.625
call in sick and say you haven't been
at the station for a week,

162
00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:04.750
and stay silent.

163
00:20:04.792 --> 00:20:05.792
Stop!

164
00:20:06.792 --> 00:20:09.167
Stop right here!
Everybody stop! Stop!

165
00:20:09.333 --> 00:20:10.533
We won't go further than this.

166
00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:13.125
- Why?
- We're scared, madam.

167
00:20:13.375 --> 00:20:14.375
Aren't you ashamed?

168
00:20:15.083 --> 00:20:16.208
You're a police officer!

169
00:20:16.708 --> 00:20:18.792
- Who are you afraid of?
- He's Ranatunga, madam.

170
00:20:18.917 --> 00:20:19.917
He's Ranatunga!

171
00:20:20.167 --> 00:20:21.250
I can't do this, madam.

172
00:20:21.458 --> 00:20:22.739
I have a family to take care of.

173
00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:24.417
I'm resigning on the spot!

174
00:20:24.750 --> 00:20:25.750
You can go ahead.

175
00:20:25.958 --> 00:20:27.079
I can't do it either, madam.

176
00:20:27.125 --> 00:20:28.125
<i>Namaste,</i> madam.

177
00:20:28.542 --> 00:20:29.417
Sorry, madam.

178
00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:30.375
Sorry, madam.

179
00:20:30.458 --> 00:20:31.750
Sorry, madam, I'm leaving too.

180
00:20:32.292 --> 00:20:33.875
All these men ran away.

181
00:20:34.542 --> 00:20:35.982
Do any of you want to leave as well?

182
00:20:36.167 --> 00:20:37.875
We will all come with you, madam!

183
00:20:45.833 --> 00:20:46.833
What…

184
00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:49.125
Beat them up!

185
00:20:50.667 --> 00:20:53.167
You good-for-nothings!

186
00:20:55.125 --> 00:20:56.667
What are you, a bunch of cowards?

187
00:21:00.125 --> 00:21:01.458
Stop them!

188
00:21:04.583 --> 00:21:05.583
Hey!

189
00:21:06.292 --> 00:21:07.292
Hey!

190
00:21:07.750 --> 00:21:08.792
Lower your voice!

191
00:21:09.542 --> 00:21:11.102
I'm letting you off because you're old!

192
00:21:11.208 --> 00:21:14.083
Or I'll strap you to the jeep
and haul you off to jail!

193
00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:15.583
How dare you...

194
00:21:17.042 --> 00:21:18.042
Mom…

195
00:21:32.958 --> 00:21:35.375
Mom, why are you upset?

196
00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:38.833
Let it go. I'll talk to her.

197
00:21:42.625 --> 00:21:43.625
Please, come inside.

198
00:21:45.708 --> 00:21:46.708
You all, too.

199
00:21:51.167 --> 00:21:52.167
Hey.

200
00:21:53.583 --> 00:21:54.583
Pour me a drink.

201
00:22:06.375 --> 00:22:08.917
You've come a long way,
would you like something to drink?

202
00:22:09.167 --> 00:22:10.208
Water or juice?

203
00:22:11.208 --> 00:22:12.208
Madam.

204
00:22:12.917 --> 00:22:15.125
We're not here to enjoy
your hospitality.

205
00:22:16.375 --> 00:22:19.083
That scum has beheaded ten people.

206
00:22:21.000 --> 00:22:21.875
Call him!

207
00:22:22.000 --> 00:22:23.875
Watch your tone, he's my husband.

208
00:22:25.292 --> 00:22:26.750
Do you have a warrant?

209
00:22:27.167 --> 00:22:28.167
Watch my tone?

210
00:22:29.083 --> 00:22:33.042
He should be beaten
and dragged naked through the streets.

211
00:22:33.750 --> 00:22:34.792
Ask him to come out!

212
00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:37.500
Do it!

213
00:22:42.333 --> 00:22:43.708
Close the door!

214
00:22:45.958 --> 00:22:46.958
Hey, Vijaya Lakshmi.

215
00:22:47.708 --> 00:22:53.458
Before coming here, you should've
remembered that you're not just a cop.

216
00:22:54.917 --> 00:22:56.167
You're also a woman.

217
00:22:57.042 --> 00:22:58.375
Strip them of their uniforms!

218
00:23:06.583 --> 00:23:07.583
Hey!

219
00:23:15.708 --> 00:23:16.708
Don't spare them!

220
00:23:46.333 --> 00:23:48.417
Seems all that energy

221
00:23:49.333 --> 00:23:51.542
has boiled down
to shame and fear now.

222
00:23:54.042 --> 00:23:56.333
The CI refused to allow a warrant.

223
00:23:58.125 --> 00:24:01.792
The policemen were scared
to set foot in the house.

224
00:24:02.458 --> 00:24:03.875
You still didn't understand?

225
00:24:04.375 --> 00:24:06.667
You barged in
after seeing ten dead bodies.

226
00:24:07.417 --> 00:24:08.417
Thousands!

227
00:24:09.250 --> 00:24:12.333
My husband is going to kill thousands!

228
00:24:13.500 --> 00:24:14.708
Bharathi's husband.

229
00:24:15.917 --> 00:24:17.042
Ranatunga!

230
00:24:19.167 --> 00:24:22.458
Back then, Rama was there
to stop Ravan.

231
00:24:23.542 --> 00:24:26.417
But no Rama has been born

232
00:24:27.042 --> 00:24:28.375
to stop Ranatunga.

233
00:24:29.750 --> 00:24:31.708
This is our Lanka.

234
00:24:33.625 --> 00:24:38.250
Even God fears entering this Lanka.

235
00:24:38.333 --> 00:24:40.173
TO UPHOLD RIGHTEOUSNESS,
I DESCEND IN EVERY AGE

236
00:24:41.833 --> 00:24:44.042
No God has come here before.

237
00:24:47.750 --> 00:24:49.292
Nor will He ever.

238
00:24:50.375 --> 00:24:51.708
HAIL LORD RAM

239
00:25:05.042 --> 00:25:06.625
<i>Hail Lord Rama!</i>

240
00:25:12.750 --> 00:25:14.500
<i>Through time and age, Rama's might</i>

241
00:25:14.583 --> 00:25:16.500
<i>Warrior with pride, facing the fight</i>

242
00:25:16.583 --> 00:25:18.375
<i>Forgiveness in mind
And weapons so true</i>

243
00:25:18.458 --> 00:25:20.333
<i>Anger controlled, in peace he grew</i>

244
00:25:20.417 --> 00:25:22.250
<i>The primal sound rings as
Rama takes his stand</i>

245
00:25:22.333 --> 00:25:24.208
<i>With arrows and might
He rules the land</i>

246
00:25:24.292 --> 00:25:26.125
<i>Vedas and scriptures
His wisdom profound</i>

247
00:25:26.208 --> 00:25:28.167
<i>The hero of both gods
And men renowned</i>

248
00:25:35.792 --> 00:25:37.667
<i>Hail Lord Rama!</i>

249
00:25:43.500 --> 00:25:47.250
<i>The drums beat loud, the echoes ring</i>

250
00:25:47.333 --> 00:25:50.708
<i>From Ayodhya they march
Hear the warriors roar</i>

251
00:25:50.792 --> 00:25:54.583
<i>Thousands of brave hearts
Strong in their fight</i>

252
00:25:54.708 --> 00:25:58.375
<i>With courage in their souls
They light the night</i>

253
00:25:59.083 --> 00:26:02.792
<i>Carrying bombs and the sharpest sword</i>

254
00:26:02.917 --> 00:26:06.125
<i>With arrows and spears
Ready to roar</i>

255
00:26:06.292 --> 00:26:09.917
<i>With Ayodhya's grace
We'll bring Ravan to his place</i>

256
00:26:10.083 --> 00:26:14.333
<i>On the field, none shall be
For your cause, we'll set them free</i>

257
00:26:14.458 --> 00:26:19.875
<i>O Rama, Sri Rama, praise to Rama
Chant His name, with reverence, proclaim</i>

258
00:26:19.958 --> 00:26:21.851
<i>Protector of the world
Lord of the dark and bright</i>

259
00:26:21.875 --> 00:26:23.750
<i>Hail Lord Ram!</i>

260
00:26:24.667 --> 00:26:25.934
THE CONSECRATION CEREMONY
OF THE RAM TEMPLE

261
00:26:25.958 --> 00:26:31.333
<i>O Rama, Sri Rama, praise to Rama
Chant His name, with reverence, proclaim</i>

262
00:26:31.417 --> 00:26:33.377
