<i>Hail Lord Rama!</i>

301
00:29:16.167 --> 00:29:17.042
What can we tell him?

302
00:29:17.167 --> 00:29:18.583
Why don't you switch off the phone?

303
00:29:19.125 --> 00:29:20.893
But we have to give him
some answers, shouldn't we?

304
00:29:20.917 --> 00:29:23.333
He gives orders like it's nothing,
sitting in his AC chamber.

305
00:29:23.417 --> 00:29:24.817
- He keeps calling...
- Excuse me, sir.

306
00:29:25.208 --> 00:29:26.125
What is this place?

307
00:29:26.208 --> 00:29:27.917
Andhra. Andhra Pradesh, sir.

308
00:29:28.167 --> 00:29:29.667
- Chirala area.
- Chirala?

309
00:29:29.750 --> 00:29:30.750
Yes, sir.

310
00:29:31.500 --> 00:29:32.708
Why has the train stopped?

311
00:29:33.292 --> 00:29:35.000
A cargo train derailed up ahead.

312
00:29:35.417 --> 00:29:36.542
It's a single track.

313
00:29:37.000 --> 00:29:40.083
The track repair train has started
from both Chennai and Vijayawada.

314
00:29:41.667 --> 00:29:43.267
It will take another four to five hours.

315
00:29:43.667 --> 00:29:44.667
Oh, damn!

316
00:29:46.083 --> 00:29:47.083
I'm hungry.

317
00:29:48.500 --> 00:29:49.500
Can we get breakfast?

318
00:29:49.583 --> 00:29:51.625
We were supposed to load it
at the next station.

319
00:29:52.167 --> 00:29:54.333
But I'm not sure about this place.

320
00:29:54.542 --> 00:29:56.125
You might get it over there.

321
00:29:56.625 --> 00:29:57.667
Over there.

322
00:30:41.083 --> 00:30:42.083
<i>Amma?</i>

323
00:30:43.167 --> 00:30:44.167
<i>Amma!</i>

324
00:30:45.375 --> 00:30:46.375
Do you have <i>dal-roti?</i>

325
00:30:46.667 --> 00:30:48.750
We don't have <i>dal-roti</i> here, son.

326
00:30:49.042 --> 00:30:52.167
We serve <i>idli, dosa,</i> and <i>vada.</i>

327
00:30:52.375 --> 00:30:54.250
- Will it be fresh and hot?
- Of course!

328
00:30:54.667 --> 00:30:56.792
We have piping hot <i>idli.</i>
Want some?

329
00:30:56.875 --> 00:30:57.875
- Yes.
- Come on.

330
00:31:03.125 --> 00:31:04.833
<i>Amma! Amma…</i>

331
00:31:07.125 --> 00:31:09.917
You work alone?
Is there no one else with you?

332
00:31:10.375 --> 00:31:11.375
There is, dear.

333
00:31:12.208 --> 00:31:13.708
But they're not with me.

334
00:31:15.292 --> 00:31:17.750
I've got to look after myself, right?

335
00:31:25.792 --> 00:31:27.458
You seem like you're new here.

336
00:31:27.708 --> 00:31:29.000
Where are you off to, son?

337
00:31:29.458 --> 00:31:30.458
Trekking.

338
00:31:31.083 --> 00:31:32.083
Oh…

339
00:31:46.083 --> 00:31:48.458
- Let's have some tea.
- Yes, let's go.

340
00:32:03.042 --> 00:32:04.809
<i>-This morning in Chennai, an unknown</i>
-Hey, make some tea!

341
00:32:04.833 --> 00:32:07.583
<i>- Person took the lives of ten people.</i>
- Hey, old hag, give me a <i>beedi.</i>

342
00:32:07.875 --> 00:32:09.893
<i>In the police inquiry,
it was revealed that the deceased were</i>

343
00:32:09.917 --> 00:32:11.708
<i>-sleeper cell terrorists,</i>
-Here.

344
00:32:11.792 --> 00:32:12.976
<i>-leaving the Tamil Nadu</i>
-Hurry up.

345
00:32:13.000 --> 00:32:14.960
<i>- Government tongue-tied!</i>
- Hey, change the channel!

346
00:32:17.167 --> 00:32:19.309
- Give me the matchbox, you old hag.
- Please wait, I'll give it to you.

347
00:32:19.333 --> 00:32:21.094
Will your dead husband
give me the matchbox?!

348
00:32:21.125 --> 00:32:22.500
- Get lost!
- Get lost!

349
00:32:31.625 --> 00:32:32.708
Get lost!

350
00:32:33.208 --> 00:32:34.208
<i>Anna.</i>

351
00:32:36.250 --> 00:32:37.250
<i>Anna?</i>

352
00:32:40.625 --> 00:32:42.125
I was enjoying my
steaming hot <i>idlis.</i>

353
00:32:43.042 --> 00:32:45.458
You shoved me, and my <i>idli</i> fell.

354
00:32:48.250 --> 00:32:49.667
You should apologize to me.

355
00:32:54.000 --> 00:32:58.833
Listen, we neither give
nor take apologies.

356
00:32:59.833 --> 00:33:00.833
Get lost!

357
00:33:01.208 --> 00:33:02.208
Get lost!

358
00:33:05.208 --> 00:33:06.208
<i>Anna?</i>

359
00:33:07.958 --> 00:33:10.042
What's your issue?
What do you want?

360
00:33:10.583 --> 00:33:12.958
<i>Anna,</i> I was eating <i>idli.</i>

361
00:33:13.500 --> 00:33:15.667
You shoved me and it fell.

362
00:33:17.458 --> 00:33:18.458
Say sorry.

363
00:33:20.750 --> 00:33:21.792
You want me to say sorry?

364
00:33:23.625 --> 00:33:24.625
Get lost!

365
00:33:25.750 --> 00:33:28.708
Hey, do you know
who you're messing with?

366
00:33:29.708 --> 00:33:31.375
Who are you?
And where are you from?

367
00:33:32.125 --> 00:33:33.792
Listen, he wants him to say sorry.

368
00:33:34.208 --> 00:33:35.542
He wants us to apologize.

369
00:33:38.875 --> 00:33:41.042
Hey! Sorry, my foot!

370
00:33:42.250 --> 00:33:43.750
Mad bugger! Get lost!

371
00:33:53.250 --> 00:33:54.250
Hey!

372
00:33:57.792 --> 00:34:01.875
The entire North has felt the force
of these two-and-a-half-kilo hands.

373
00:34:03.042 --> 00:34:04.917
Now, it's the South's turn.

374
00:34:06.375 --> 00:34:07.667
When I lift these hands,

375
00:34:08.792 --> 00:34:12.042
the whole nation will rejoice!

376
00:34:13.250 --> 00:34:14.250
Say sorry!

377
00:34:27.083 --> 00:34:28.083
Hey!

378
00:35:59.250 --> 00:36:00.250
Apologize!

379
00:36:03.125 --> 00:36:04.833
Who the hell are you?!

380
00:36:05.333 --> 00:36:07.334
How dare you step into our territory
and attack us?

381
00:36:07.458 --> 00:36:09.208
Do you know who we work for?

382
00:36:13.000 --> 00:36:14.000
Tell me.

383
00:36:14.167 --> 00:36:15.833
Ram Subba Reddy.

384
00:36:16.083 --> 00:36:17.250
So, is he going to apologize?

385
00:36:18.625 --> 00:36:19.625
Let's go!

386
00:36:21.875 --> 00:36:23.875
You need not worry, Somulu <i>Anna.</i>

387
00:36:25.000 --> 00:36:26.667
This is Ram Subba Reddy.

388
00:36:28.042 --> 00:36:29.750
Twenty boys are coming from Kotluru,

389
00:36:29.917 --> 00:36:31.958
and forty from Ramayapatnam.

390
00:36:32.250 --> 00:36:34.750
Hey! Be careful!

391
00:36:39.542 --> 00:36:40.792
Don't worry, <i>Anna.</i>

392
00:36:41.125 --> 00:36:42.366
The job will be finished today.

393
00:36:42.833 --> 00:36:44.633
- I'm telling you.
- Call him. What is he doing?

394
00:36:44.667 --> 00:36:46.583
- Let me check.
- No, no. Those boys

395
00:36:46.667 --> 00:36:49.458
from Ungol aren't answering their phones.

396
00:36:50.333 --> 00:36:51.333
You…

397
00:36:51.458 --> 00:36:53.250
Alright. I'll call you back.

398
00:36:54.417 --> 00:36:55.417
Hey, woman!

399
00:36:55.458 --> 00:36:58.792
What are you doing just loitering here?

400
00:36:58.875 --> 00:37:01.000
- What the…
- They're waiting.

401
00:37:01.208 --> 00:37:02.458
Shove some coffee their way!

402
00:37:02.542 --> 00:37:04.042
I already served them an hour back.

403
00:37:04.375 --> 00:37:05.375
They must wait!

404
00:37:07.250 --> 00:37:09.625
Alright, that's enough!

405
00:37:09.750 --> 00:37:11.208
Come on. Out of the way.

406
00:37:11.667 --> 00:37:12.750
Hey, move!

407
00:37:15.458 --> 00:37:16.458
My child…

408
00:37:16.750 --> 00:37:21.083
Makeup and touch-ups don't
change a thing on our faces. Get up.

409
00:37:21.250 --> 00:37:23.042
- Get up, dear.
- Daddy!

410
00:37:23.375 --> 00:37:24.958
Come on, up!

411
00:37:25.250 --> 00:37:26.542
- Come.
- What are you doing?

412
00:37:30.917 --> 00:37:31.917
Hey!

413
00:37:32.333 --> 00:37:33.500
Who's the groom?

414
00:37:34.875 --> 00:37:35.875
You?

415
00:37:36.125 --> 00:37:38.333
Here's the bride.
Do you like her?

416
00:37:39.375 --> 00:37:40.375
Of course, you do!

417
00:37:40.708 --> 00:37:43.958
You two are just right
for each other. Sit down!

418
00:37:45.208 --> 00:37:46.333
Where are the parents?

419
00:37:48.583 --> 00:37:49.583
Oh!

420
00:37:51.083 --> 00:37:54.042
Your dad looks like a country bumpkin,

421
00:37:54.333 --> 00:37:56.774
and your mom looks like she's
just an extra in the background.

422
00:37:56.833 --> 00:37:57.708
Excellent.

423
00:37:57.792 --> 00:38:00.167
- What are you saying?
- How much do you want? Shut up!

424
00:38:00.917 --> 00:38:01.957
Tell me how much you want.

425
00:38:04.917 --> 00:38:06.000
Fine, I'll say it then.

426
00:38:06.833 --> 00:38:08.292
Only one daughter.

427
00:38:08.500 --> 00:38:11.500
My whole empire is hers
and her husband's.

428
00:38:12.083 --> 00:38:13.083
Sit!

429
00:38:13.833 --> 00:38:14.833
You get up.

430
00:38:15.458 --> 00:38:16.333
What is your job?

431
00:38:16.417 --> 00:38:18.018
I'm a software engineer in Bangalore, sir.

432
00:38:18.042 --> 00:38:19.125
To hell with your software!

433
00:38:20.167 --> 00:38:21.042
Hey!

434
00:38:21.125 --> 00:38:22.792
Forget Bangalore and Mangalore.

435
00:38:23.208 --> 00:38:24.875
I'm 100 times more!

436
00:38:25.583 --> 00:38:27.375
Now you work from home.

437
00:38:27.750 --> 00:38:28.792
What are you thinking?

438
00:38:29.167 --> 00:38:30.458
Do you know who I am?

439
00:38:32.500 --> 00:38:35.000
Who's the wealthiest in this village?

440
00:38:35.500 --> 00:38:36.500
I am!

441
00:38:36.792 --> 00:38:39.375
Who's the most powerful in this area?

442
00:38:39.708 --> 00:38:40.708
I am!

443
00:38:40.750 --> 00:38:42.667
Who's the king of thugs?

444
00:38:42.833 --> 00:38:43.833
Me!

445
00:38:43.917 --> 00:38:45.667
Who's the political kingmaker?

446
00:38:45.750 --> 00:38:46.625
I am!

447
00:38:46.708 --> 00:38:48.542
- Who's Ram Subba Reddy?
- I am!

448
00:38:57.250 --> 00:38:58.250
Say sorry.

449
00:39:00.667 --> 00:39:01.542
Hey!

450
00:39:01.625 --> 00:39:04.417
You hit me, then ask me to apologize?
Are you crazy?

451
00:39:04.500 --> 00:39:06.292
- I was enjoying my <i>idli.</i>
- Okay.

452
00:39:06.375 --> 00:39:07.417
He shoved me.

453
00:39:08.125 --> 00:39:09.208
The <i>idli</i> fell.

454
00:39:09.375 --> 00:39:11.250
I told him to say sorry.

455
00:39:12.125 --> 00:39:13.125
He…

456
00:39:14.500 --> 00:39:15.583
Threw your name around.

457
00:39:16.750 --> 00:39:17.750
Say sorry.

458
00:39:18.542 --> 00:39:19.542
Apologize!

459
00:39:21.125 --> 00:39:23.000
You crazy woman!
I will...

460
00:39:23.083 --> 00:39:25.917
Your husband is getting thrashed
and you're laughing?

461
00:39:26.083 --> 00:39:28.542
You want me to get beaten up, right?

462
00:39:28.958 --> 00:39:30.042
It's sadness, dear.

463
00:39:30.333 --> 00:39:33.292
- But in the form of laughter.
- I will…

464
00:39:33.375 --> 00:39:35.167
- Now what do you want?
- Say sorry.

465
00:39:35.708 --> 00:39:38.083
Stop it! Is this a hand or a hammer?

466
00:39:38.833 --> 00:39:40.458
Hey, you fools!

467
00:39:40.542 --> 00:39:42.792
Why are you still stuffing your faces?

468
00:39:42.875 --> 00:39:45.042
Stop looking at me and finish him off!

469
00:39:59.000 --> 00:40:00.417
What happened?

470
00:40:01.875 --> 00:40:02.917
Just missed.

471
00:40:03.417 --> 00:40:04.583
Oh, okay.

472
00:40:29.750 --> 00:40:32.125
- What's happening now?
- It got torn.

473
00:40:32.500 --> 00:40:34.708
- Whose?
- Ram Subba Reddy's.

474
00:40:34.875 --> 00:40:37.250
- That's great!
- You old hag!

475
00:40:39.667 --> 00:40:40.667
Hey!

476
00:40:43.250 --> 00:40:47.458
You came into my territory
and beat me like a dog.

477
00:40:48.167 --> 00:40:50.458
If my brother hears about this,

478
00:40:50.542 --> 00:40:54.542
he'll strip you naked
and cut you down in public.

479
00:41:00.083 --> 00:41:01.083
Who is he?

480
00:41:01.125 --> 00:41:02.292
Somulu!

481
00:41:03.250 --> 00:41:04.750
My background.

482
00:41:05.167 --> 00:41:06.250
Will he say sorry?

483
00:41:20.708 --> 00:41:22.029
Why did you bring an entire army?

484
00:41:22.375 --> 00:41:25.792
Didn't I tell you
one officer would be enough?

485
00:41:26.042 --> 00:41:27.958
Who has served in the Prakasam district?

486
00:41:29.042 --> 00:41:30.042
<i>Jai Hind,</i> sir.

487
00:41:30.292 --> 00:41:31.792
I was an SP there for five years.

488
00:41:32.125 --> 00:41:34.125
- I know the Prakasam district very well.
- But, sir…

489
00:41:34.542 --> 00:41:37.125
Sorry, sir. The weather is bad.
We can't take the chopper.

490
00:41:38.042 --> 00:41:39.292
We can go by road, sir.

491
00:41:39.417 --> 00:41:41.708
We'll reach Motupalli
in four to five hours, sir.

492
00:41:42.292 --> 00:41:45.333
Okay. Please collect the files
from the Revenue Department.

493
00:41:45.958 --> 00:41:46.958
- Let's go.
- Sir.

494
00:41:50.458 --> 00:41:52.750
<i>You even bought the MPs in Parliament?</i>

495
00:41:54.750 --> 00:41:56.875
Needs can compel a man to sell out,

496
00:41:57.458 --> 00:42:00.667
but in India,
selling yourself is a compulsion.

497
00:42:05.375 --> 00:42:07.167
Sir, CBI officer Satya Murthy

498
00:42:07.250 --> 00:42:09.611
<i>is currently heading toward Motupalli
from Begumpet Airport.</i>

499
00:42:09.833 --> 00:42:11.153
<i>- Please take care of this.</i>
- What?!

500
00:42:12.083 --> 00:42:13.083
Motupalli?

501
00:42:23.542 --> 00:42:24.417
<i>Hello?</i>

502
00:42:24.542 --> 00:42:25.625
Minister <i>sahib,</i> tell me.

503
00:42:25.792 --> 00:42:29.958
What was meant to stay hidden
has reached Delhi.

504
00:42:30.583 --> 00:42:33.958
A dangerous CBI officer,
Satya Murthy, is on his way.

505
00:42:34.667 --> 00:42:39.292
Get rid of all the evidence
before he arrives.

506
00:42:40.083 --> 00:42:41.667
Finish it quickly.

507
00:42:41.792 --> 00:42:43.500
Ranatunga has given you his word.

508
00:42:44.500 --> 00:42:45.625
It will be done.

509
00:42:46.250 --> 00:42:47.542
Don't worry too much.

510
00:42:56.875 --> 00:42:57.875
Where is Somulu?

511
00:43:18.375 --> 00:43:19.375
Sir,

512
00:43:19.542 --> 00:43:21.000
these papers are blank, sir.

513
00:43:21.500 --> 00:43:23.542
Signing and stamping them…

514
00:43:24.875 --> 00:43:25.875
Would be illegal, sir.

515
00:43:26.083 --> 00:43:27.750
Legal or illegal,

516
00:43:28.042 --> 00:43:29.082
it's all under my control.

517
00:43:37.875 --> 00:43:39.000
Whose phone is that?

518
00:43:47.667 --> 00:43:49.208
Whose damn phone is ringing?!

519
00:43:52.125 --> 00:43:53.000
Mine.

520
00:43:53.125 --> 00:43:54.125
Pick it up.

521
00:44:18.208 --> 00:44:19.333
- Put it on speaker.
<i>- Hello?</i>

522
00:44:19.500 --> 00:44:21.417
<i>Hello? Can you hear me?</i>

523
00:44:22.167 --> 00:44:23.208
<i>- Hello?</i>
- Hello.

524
00:44:23.542 --> 00:44:24.917
<i>Did you have lunch?</i>

525
00:44:25.667 --> 00:44:26.667
Yes.

526
00:44:27.083 --> 00:44:28.375
Where's your "background"?

527
00:44:28.833 --> 00:44:30.167
When I was on the phone earlier,

528
00:44:30.750 --> 00:44:31.833
he was right here.

529
00:44:35.125 --> 00:44:36.333
No one's here.

530
00:44:36.958 --> 00:44:39.875
If he's not here,
he'll be at the timber warehouse.

531
00:44:39.958 --> 00:44:41.750
<i>I put the tablets in your pocket.</i>

532
00:44:42.042 --> 00:44:43.143
<i>Take them after eating something.</i>

533
00:44:43.167 --> 00:44:44.875
<i>Otherwise, your blood pressure will drop.</i>

534
00:44:45.333 --> 00:44:46.333
Yes, I'll take them.

535
00:44:48.208 --> 00:44:49.208
You have low BP?

536
00:44:49.958 --> 00:44:50.958
Yes.

537
00:44:56.500 --> 00:44:57.500
Help.

538
00:45:01.125 --> 00:45:05.208
One tablet won't raise
your blood pressure,

539
00:45:05.500 --> 00:45:09.750
but if you take them all at once,
it definitely will.

540
00:45:10.333 --> 00:45:13.125
If he's not there either,
he'll be at the sand quarry.

541
00:45:14.792 --> 00:45:16.832
Can you tell me one place
where he'll definitely be?

542
00:45:17.708 --> 00:45:19.625
No! No!

543
00:45:20.667 --> 00:45:23.833
Then he's definitely at the sand quarry.

544
00:45:27.833 --> 00:45:28.833
Hey!

545
00:45:32.583 --> 00:45:34.500
Anyone else want tablets?

546
00:45:35.333 --> 00:45:37.708
Finish the job within an hour!

547
00:45:55.417 --> 00:45:56.417
Hey!

548
00:45:57.250 --> 00:45:58.250
Check it out.

549
00:46:26.917 --> 00:46:27.917
Hey!

550
00:46:28.542 --> 00:46:29.667
Who is Somulu?

551
00:46:54.333 --> 00:46:55.333
Hey!

552
00:46:55.917 --> 00:46:56.792
Where is Somulu?!

553
00:46:56.875 --> 00:46:59.292
It's my job to break things,

554
00:46:59.875 --> 00:47:02.250
but you broke the door and barged in.

555
00:47:02.333 --> 00:47:03.333
Loved it!

556
00:47:05.083 --> 00:47:06.458
I am Somulu.

557
00:47:07.375 --> 00:47:08.375
What do you want?

558
00:47:09.833 --> 00:47:10.708
Say sorry.

559
00:47:10.792 --> 00:47:11.792
What?!

560
00:47:13.500 --> 00:47:14.500
What did he say?

561
00:47:16.667 --> 00:47:17.917
He's asking you to apologize.

562
00:47:19.875 --> 00:47:21.583
I'm already in a bad mood.
Apologize now!

563
00:47:21.667 --> 00:47:22.667
Hey!

564
00:47:25.375 --> 00:47:26.375
I'm talking.

565
00:47:27.500 --> 00:47:30.250
Why should I apologize, Crack Man?

566
00:47:30.542 --> 00:47:31.625
I was eating <i>idli.</i>

567
00:47:31.792 --> 00:47:33.667
- What?!
- He shoved me.

568
00:47:33.917 --> 00:47:35.458
- Who?
- Just shut up!

569
00:47:36.542 --> 00:47:37.542
The <i>idli</i> fell.

570
00:47:38.458 --> 00:47:40.250
He mentioned Ram Subba Reddy's name.

571
00:47:41.250 --> 00:47:42.250
And he…

572
00:47:43.208 --> 00:47:44.208
Mentioned your name.

573
00:47:46.250 --> 00:47:47.667
Now, say sorry.

574
00:48:05.000 --> 00:48:08.000
Don't talk before fighting.

575
00:48:08.917 --> 00:48:11.458
He may have mentioned Somulu's name,

576
00:48:12.667 --> 00:48:14.750
but you probably don't know…

577
00:48:16.458 --> 00:48:18.042
What this Somulu can do.

578
00:48:19.708 --> 00:48:20.708
Go!

579
00:48:32.458 --> 00:48:34.625
- Say sorry.
- Get lost!

580
00:48:43.417 --> 00:48:45.417
Once I start thrashing people,

581
00:48:46.333 --> 00:48:47.667
I don't stop to count

582
00:48:48.167 --> 00:48:49.250
or listen!

583
00:48:50.083 --> 00:48:52.417
So, apologize now!

584
00:49:22.375 --> 00:49:23.458
Apologize!

585
00:49:45.583 --> 00:49:48.167
Is he a cop?

586
00:49:48.458 --> 00:49:49.708
Maybe he's an SI.

587
00:49:49.792 --> 00:49:52.208
No, he must be the SP.

588
00:49:58.875 --> 00:50:00.708
Look at the way he fights, boss.

589
00:50:00.875 --> 00:50:02.208
He must be a commissioner!

590
00:50:40.667 --> 00:50:41.667
Crack Man!

591
00:50:42.292 --> 00:50:44.083
You'll start flying now!

592
00:50:44.792 --> 00:50:47.250
You won't be leaving
on your own two feet.

593
00:50:49.750 --> 00:50:51.875
Only your corpse will leave this place!

594
00:50:52.292 --> 00:50:53.500
Thrash this scoundrel!

595
00:51:41.708 --> 00:51:42.708
Apologize!

596
00:51:43.250 --> 00:51:44.375
Are you crazy?!

597
00:51:45.292 --> 00:51:48.583
If my <i>Anna</i> finds out about this,
he'll drink your blood!

598
00:51:51.500 --> 00:51:52.500
Who is he?

599
00:51:53.333 --> 00:51:55.042
Ranatunga!

600
00:52:16.917 --> 00:52:18.375
Who is this Ranatunga?

601
00:52:18.917 --> 00:52:20.333
Sir, fifteen years ago,

602
00:52:20.792 --> 00:52:22.292
<i>a corrupt police officer,</i>

603
00:52:22.583 --> 00:52:23.875
<i>bribed with gold bricks,</i>

604
00:52:24.000 --> 00:52:27.000
<i>let four notorious international
criminals into our country.</i>

605
00:52:28.458 --> 00:52:31.667
Ranatunga bribed his way
into becoming an Indian citizen.

606
00:52:32.208 --> 00:52:36.167
He then went on to build
his criminal empire here.

607
00:52:59.083 --> 00:53:00.083
Who are you?

608
00:53:02.167 --> 00:53:03.042
What do you want?

609
00:53:03.125 --> 00:53:04.000
<i>Anna!</i>

610
00:53:04.083 --> 00:53:06.208
Do you have a fat pig with you?

611
00:53:06.375 --> 00:53:07.375
Oh!

612
00:53:07.625 --> 00:53:08.625
Check for yourselves.

613
00:53:23.708 --> 00:53:24.583
Did you find it?

614
00:53:24.667 --> 00:53:25.667
Not yet, <i>Anna.</i>

615
00:53:33.375 --> 00:53:34.875
Hey! Did you find one?

616
00:53:35.167 --> 00:53:36.708
Not yet. We're still looking for it.

617
00:53:41.542 --> 00:53:43.417
I got it.

618
00:53:45.583 --> 00:53:46.583
What are you doing here?

619
00:53:47.250 --> 00:53:48.375
You just told me.

620
00:53:49.000 --> 00:53:50.625
Not a small one, but a large one.

621
00:54:03.167 --> 00:54:04.833
No! Let him go!

622
00:54:07.417 --> 00:54:08.958
Oh, God!

623
00:54:47.917 --> 00:54:48.917
Hey!

624
00:54:49.250 --> 00:54:51.750
You don't just need a boat
to go into the river,

625
00:54:52.208 --> 00:54:53.875
but you'll also need to pay a commission

626
00:54:53.958 --> 00:54:56.375
to Pandulu Narayana
and get his permission.

627
00:54:59.875 --> 00:55:02.542
What are these permission-commission
shenanigans, you scoundrel?!

628
00:55:03.500 --> 00:55:05.083
Does your father own this river?

629
00:55:05.167 --> 00:55:06.518
- You swine…
- Beat this scoundrel up!

630
00:55:06.542 --> 00:55:07.542
Hey!

631
00:55:08.542 --> 00:55:09.542
Know your place!

632
00:55:09.875 --> 00:55:13.333
You filthy, worthless porter!
Take that attitude elsewhere.

633
00:55:13.417 --> 00:55:15.542
If you want to live here,
you'll have to kiss my feet!

634
00:55:15.875 --> 00:55:17.375
You'll obey every command I give!

635
00:55:17.833 --> 00:55:19.333
You'll pay me rent for the boat

636
00:55:19.583 --> 00:55:21.500
and give me a share of your catch.

637
00:55:22.208 --> 00:55:23.208
Do you understand?

638
00:55:25.583 --> 00:55:26.583
Let's go!

639
00:55:57.958 --> 00:55:59.458
You called me a porter.

640
00:56:00.958 --> 00:56:01.958
I'll accept that.

641
00:56:02.875 --> 00:56:05.167
You told me to leave the village.

642
00:56:07.667 --> 00:56:08.667
I'll accept that too.

643
00:56:10.583 --> 00:56:13.458
But anyone who raises a hand
against my brother…

644
00:56:17.250 --> 00:56:19.125
Will die like a pig!

645
00:56:37.708 --> 00:56:39.417
Filthy, worthless porter!

646
00:56:40.792 --> 00:56:43.512
We gave you shelter with no address,
and now you think you can kill?!

647
00:56:44.042 --> 00:56:46.242
If you try to act smart,
I'll kill every last one of you

648
00:56:46.292 --> 00:56:47.625
and dump your bodies in the sea!

649
00:57:04.500 --> 00:57:07.875
<i>After those two murders,
fear gripped the entire region.</i>

650
00:57:09.375 --> 00:57:11.500
Ranatunga took that fear…

651
00:57:12.625 --> 00:57:15.083
And turned it into the darkness
of an endless night.

652
00:58:16.417 --> 00:58:18.292
<i>Slowly,</i>

653
00:58:18.833 --> 00:58:22.500
<i>he began recruiting boys
between sixteen and eighteen,</i>

654
00:58:22.917 --> 00:58:24.167
<i>luring them with motorcycles,</i>

655
00:58:24.500 --> 00:58:26.000
<i>unlimited booze,</i>

656
00:58:26.167 --> 00:58:27.500
<i>weed, and drugs.</i>

657
00:58:37.458 --> 00:58:39.375
<i>Once he had established his empire,</i>

658
00:58:39.708 --> 00:58:41.375
<i>Ranatunga gradually</i>

659
00:58:41.833 --> 00:58:44.458
<i>brought his family over from Sri Lanka,</i>

660
00:58:44.583 --> 00:58:46.958
<i>followed by his henchmen.</i>

661
00:58:47.417 --> 00:58:48.792
And in those forty villages,

662
00:58:49.667 --> 00:58:51.250
it's not our government that rules…

663
00:58:53.417 --> 00:58:55.042
But Ranatunga!

664
00:58:58.833 --> 00:59:01.167
<i>That's how he built his army.</i>

665
00:59:01.583 --> 00:59:02.792
<i>And before anyone realized it,</i>

666
00:59:03.458 --> 00:59:05.750
<i>he had taken control of forty villages.</i>

667
00:59:06.750 --> 00:59:08.208
In the past fifteen years,

668
00:59:09.458 --> 00:59:11.208
no one in that region…

669
00:59:12.417 --> 00:59:14.177
Has managed to put even a dent
in his empire.

670
00:59:43.917 --> 00:59:44.958
<i>Your Jaat!</i>

671
00:59:53.542 --> 00:59:58.583
- Hey, where's your brother?
<i>- The Jaats, jewels of the land</i>

672
00:59:58.667 --> 01:00:03.625
<i>We break all barriers with our hands</i>

673
01:00:04.208 --> 01:00:06.458
<i>Step back</i>

674
01:00:06.583 --> 01:00:08.875
<i>-The Jaat moves ahead</i>
-Hey!

675
01:00:08.958 --> 01:00:11.542
- What are you doing?
<i>- With strength and spirit</i>

676
01:00:11.625 --> 01:00:13.750
<i>We rise instead</i>

677
01:00:26.000 --> 01:00:27.000
<i>Anna!</i>

678
01:00:36.667 --> 01:00:37.667
Hey!

679
01:00:43.958 --> 01:00:45.083
Call your brother.

680
01:01:02.667 --> 01:01:03.917
<i>Anna!</i>

681
01:01:07.000 --> 01:01:08.583
<i>Anna!</i>

682
01:01:58.292 --> 01:01:59.292
Who are you?

683
01:02:02.417 --> 01:02:03.417
Say sorry.

684
01:02:04.417 --> 01:02:05.417
Sorry?

685
01:02:12.625 --> 01:02:13.625
For what?

686
01:02:19.750 --> 01:02:21.708
I was eating <i>idli.</i>

687
01:02:22.042 --> 01:02:24.292
Oh, God! There he goes again.

688
01:02:24.417 --> 01:02:25.625
He shoved me.

689
01:02:26.167 --> 01:02:27.417
- The <i>idli</i> fell.
- The <i>idli</i> fell.

690
01:02:28.125 --> 01:02:30.042
I asked him to say sorry.

691
01:02:30.917 --> 01:02:31.958
He refused.

692
01:02:33.292 --> 01:02:34.292
So I…

693
01:02:34.750 --> 01:02:35.917
Beat him to a pulp.

694
01:02:36.375 --> 01:02:39.375
He mentioned Rama Subba Reddy.

695
01:02:40.458 --> 01:02:43.458
Rama Subba Reddy
didn't apologize either.

696
01:02:44.458 --> 01:02:45.458
He…

697
01:02:46.542 --> 01:02:49.083
Mentioned Somulu!

698
01:02:52.167 --> 01:02:53.167
And this one…

699
01:02:54.833 --> 01:02:55.833
Mentioned you.

700
01:03:03.083 --> 01:03:04.500
Will you apologize,

701
01:03:05.333 --> 01:03:07.708
or will you also pass the buck?

702
01:03:32.875 --> 01:03:36.167
You made a mountain out of a molehill.

703
01:03:40.125 --> 01:03:41.125
You idiot!

704
01:03:47.417 --> 01:03:48.417
<i>Thambi,</i>

705
01:03:49.917 --> 01:03:52.292
there's no one above me.

706
01:03:53.333 --> 01:03:55.708
The buck stops with me!

707
01:03:58.458 --> 01:03:59.458
Sorry.

708
01:04:05.167 --> 01:04:06.167
What?

709
01:04:06.875 --> 01:04:07.875
What?

710
01:04:19.333 --> 01:04:20.375
Sorry.

711
01:04:24.833 --> 01:04:26.292
Sounds so good!

712
01:04:28.292 --> 01:04:30.292
I am satisfied.

713
01:04:37.667 --> 01:04:38.667
Love you, sir.

714
01:04:41.833 --> 01:04:45.958
I would have left
if you had apologized earlier.

715
01:04:46.042 --> 01:04:49.833
That's why you're here
and he's <i>there.</i>

716
01:04:53.500 --> 01:04:54.500
Love you, sir.

717
01:05:28.208 --> 01:05:29.875
- Why is he coming back?
- Brother!

718
01:05:30.083 --> 01:05:32.417
- Who else does he want an apology from?
- You?

719
01:05:58.333 --> 01:06:01.083
Hey, you wanted me to apologize,
didn't you?

720
01:06:02.208 --> 01:06:03.208
I did.

721
01:06:04.083 --> 01:06:05.083
Now get lost.

722
01:06:07.667 --> 01:06:09.227
I've been observing since this morning.

723
01:06:10.542 --> 01:06:12.917
Those people at the <i>dhaba</i> were armed.

724
01:06:16.500 --> 01:06:20.542
There were sacks of money
at Rama Subba Reddy's house.

725
01:06:24.292 --> 01:06:28.542
Blank papers were being stamped
at the registration office.

726
01:06:30.875 --> 01:06:32.208
And right outside your house,

727
01:06:32.833 --> 01:06:36.208
there's a police jeep
covered with a tarpaulin.

728
01:06:42.625 --> 01:06:44.208
And inside your house…

729
01:08:33.583 --> 01:08:37.125
You morons!
He barged into my house

730
01:08:37.250 --> 01:08:39.458
and thrashed my son!

731
01:08:40.167 --> 01:08:42.583
What are you looking at,
you imbecile? Kill him!

732
01:11:02.625 --> 01:11:04.917
I raised my hand for a simple "sorry."

733
01:11:06.625 --> 01:11:10.167
I can kill for a girl's dignity.

734
01:11:10.500 --> 01:11:13.833
- Why do you care?
- They're my sisters!

735
01:11:16.833 --> 01:11:20.125
Their plight has made me furious.

736
01:11:21.375 --> 01:11:24.250
I'm taking them with me.

737
01:11:25.167 --> 01:11:26.583
Shoot me!

738
01:11:26.958 --> 01:11:32.083
The very land you stand on, the sky,

739
01:11:33.167 --> 01:11:34.292
the ocean…

740
01:11:35.083 --> 01:11:36.292
I own it all!

741
01:11:37.542 --> 01:11:41.458
The sun begs me for light.

742
01:11:42.625 --> 01:11:46.792
The ocean fears my depths.

743
01:11:48.250 --> 01:11:49.250
Shoot!

744
01:11:49.958 --> 01:11:51.292
I am a Jaat.

745
01:11:52.583 --> 01:11:55.750
Even after being beheaded,
our hands do not drop the weapon.

746
01:11:56.792 --> 01:12:00.417
I will burn you and your Lanka to dust.

747
01:12:00.708 --> 01:12:03.750
If you're a Jaat, then I'm Ranatunga.

748
01:12:04.583 --> 01:12:06.167
You're no match for my madness.

749
01:12:07.292 --> 01:12:09.208
This is Ranatunga's Lanka.

750
01:12:09.958 --> 01:12:12.458
Here, roads aren't measured in miles

751
01:12:13.292 --> 01:12:15.292
but by the number of corpses on them.

752
01:12:15.667 --> 01:12:17.750
- Shoot.
- Shoot!

753
01:12:18.167 --> 01:12:19.500
- Let it go.
- Hey!

754
01:12:20.792 --> 01:12:21.792
Shoot!

755
01:12:25.917 --> 01:12:28.208
Don't make any rash decisions
in your anger.

756
01:12:29.417 --> 01:12:30.958
We have a job to do.

757
01:12:35.667 --> 01:12:38.208
Let it go.
We'll deal with it later.

758
01:13:05.583 --> 01:13:07.667
You like flaunting your power, don't you?

759
01:13:08.500 --> 01:13:09.500
Go on.

760
01:13:10.250 --> 01:13:11.250
Take them with you.

761
01:13:44.500 --> 01:13:45.500
Hey, Jaat, listen up!

762
01:13:46.750 --> 01:13:51.417
You can't take a step without
running into Ranatunga here.

763
01:13:53.042 --> 01:13:57.375
You'll be begging for death
before the sun goes down.

764
01:13:58.708 --> 01:13:59.708
Alright.

765
01:14:00.750 --> 01:14:01.750
We'll see how that goes.

766
01:14:12.667 --> 01:14:13.542
<i>Your Jaat</i>

767
01:14:13.625 --> 01:14:17.500
<i>The Jaats, jewels of the land</i>

768
01:14:17.583 --> 01:14:22.542
<i>We break all barriers with our hands</i>

769
01:14:23.167 --> 01:14:27.917
<i>Step back, the Jaat moves ahead</i>

770
01:14:28.000 --> 01:14:32.750
<i>With strength and spirit
We rise instead</i>

771
01:14:42.083 --> 01:14:43.167
<i>Your Jaat!</i>

772
01:15:04.250 --> 01:15:05.667
Where is your police station?

773
01:15:08.000 --> 01:15:09.583
Ours is a rural station, sir.

774
01:15:09.833 --> 01:15:11.750
It's about eight kilometers from here.

775
01:15:43.583 --> 01:15:44.583
Tell me.

776
01:15:48.625 --> 01:15:49.625
Look,

777
01:15:50.083 --> 01:15:52.583
the roads in our state
are in terrible condition.

778
01:15:53.083 --> 01:15:55.333
They're full of potholes.
Where will you go?

779
01:15:58.292 --> 01:15:59.875
My guest house is nearby.

780
01:16:00.750 --> 01:16:02.542
