We want justice!

1032
01:36:12.583 --> 01:36:13.917
We want justice!

1033
01:36:14.000 --> 01:36:15.208
We want justice!

1034
01:36:15.292 --> 01:36:16.333
This is our land!

1035
01:36:16.417 --> 01:36:18.125
This is our land!

1036
01:36:19.583 --> 01:36:20.583
Then what is this?

1037
01:36:23.833 --> 01:36:27.042
"We, the villagers,
deprived of education and development,

1038
01:36:27.500 --> 01:36:32.333
have only had fishing
as our means of livelihood."

1039
01:36:33.708 --> 01:36:37.167
"In light of the changing times
and the dangers of the sea,

1040
01:36:37.375 --> 01:36:42.458
we are voluntarily selling our land
to Ranatunga Fisheries Company."

1041
01:36:43.292 --> 01:36:44.917
- No, sir.
- "And in return,

1042
01:36:45.583 --> 01:36:51.125
Mr. Ranatunga has paid us
the full market value."

1043
01:36:51.750 --> 01:36:52.750
How much did he pay you?

1044
01:36:52.917 --> 01:36:54.125
- What?!
- Proof!

1045
01:36:54.375 --> 01:36:55.809
Your system requires proof, doesn't it?

1046
01:36:55.833 --> 01:36:57.375
Mind your damn tongue!

1047
01:36:57.500 --> 01:37:00.458
Sir, instead of accepting bribes from him,
become his mistress.

1048
01:37:00.708 --> 01:37:03.042
Taking a commission
is better than taking a bribe.

1049
01:37:05.250 --> 01:37:07.875
He attacked a government official.

1050
01:37:08.083 --> 01:37:09.083
Arrest them all!

1051
01:37:09.208 --> 01:37:10.875
- Arrest them!
- That's a lie!

1052
01:37:42.167 --> 01:37:43.167
Uncle!

1053
01:37:50.542 --> 01:37:54.708
We all grew up playing on your lap.

1054
01:37:55.958 --> 01:37:56.958
But today,

1055
01:37:57.542 --> 01:38:00.417
we're leaving you.

1056
01:38:02.583 --> 01:38:04.125
Wherever we go…

1057
01:38:06.792 --> 01:38:10.750
Please bless us and watch over us.

1058
01:38:12.208 --> 01:38:15.333
Please never leave us.

1059
01:38:24.167 --> 01:38:25.917
- Uncle…
- Come, let's go.

1060
01:38:26.000 --> 01:38:28.833
- No, no, no!
- Uncle, please don't go!

1061
01:38:28.917 --> 01:38:31.958
- Uncle, please don't go!
- Hey, stop!

1062
01:38:32.042 --> 01:38:32.958
- Uncle…
- Stop!

1063
01:38:33.042 --> 01:38:36.167
- Stop! Where are you going?
- Don't go.

1064
01:38:36.292 --> 01:38:38.625
What if you encounter another demon there?

1065
01:38:38.708 --> 01:38:39.917
What will you do then?

1066
01:38:55.250 --> 01:39:00.042
Brother, Mom said
we'll have to leave the village.

1067
01:39:01.958 --> 01:39:06.208
Raja, Chinni, Lakshmika,
no one will be there with me.

1068
01:39:06.792 --> 01:39:08.542
We'll all be separated.

1069
01:39:10.500 --> 01:39:12.250
I read in school that

1070
01:39:12.583 --> 01:39:17.167
a small child once wrote a letter
to President Giani Zail Singh,

1071
01:39:17.625 --> 01:39:19.875
saying her school had been shut down.

1072
01:39:20.208 --> 01:39:24.000
Then the President himself came
and reopened the school.

1073
01:39:25.042 --> 01:39:30.167
If I write a letter to the President,
will she help me too?

1074
01:39:35.167 --> 01:39:36.167
Brother?

1075
01:39:36.292 --> 01:39:37.292
Hey!

1076
01:39:41.458 --> 01:39:46.583
When God speaks,
He speaks through a child.

1077
01:39:47.750 --> 01:39:49.167
This is God's will.

1078
01:39:49.833 --> 01:39:52.458
The Lord has spoken!

1079
01:39:55.792 --> 01:39:56.708
We will write a letter, dear.

1080
01:39:56.792 --> 01:39:58.917
- We'll write.
- We'll definitely write.

1081
01:40:02.292 --> 01:40:03.750
To the Honorable President,

1082
01:40:05.500 --> 01:40:07.875
I'm writing this letter from Motupalli,

1083
01:40:09.208 --> 01:40:10.417
a small village

1084
01:40:10.917 --> 01:40:12.917
in the Prakasam district
of Andhra Pradesh.

1085
01:40:15.000 --> 01:40:16.667
I am studying in the third grade.

1086
01:40:17.625 --> 01:40:18.625
But now,

1087
01:40:19.083 --> 01:40:20.684
I won't be able
to attend school anymore.

1088
01:40:24.042 --> 01:40:27.250
Our forefathers were all born here,

1089
01:40:27.917 --> 01:40:30.750
but we're being told that
we'll have to leave this village.

1090
01:40:31.875 --> 01:40:33.375
If we leave the village,

1091
01:40:34.375 --> 01:40:37.000
no one will ever know
the injustices happening here.

1092
01:40:37.167 --> 01:40:40.417
Our homes, land, and everything
have been taken from us.

1093
01:40:46.208 --> 01:40:47.708
Out of 15,000 people,

1094
01:40:48.833 --> 01:40:50.292
only 500 remain.

1095
01:40:51.583 --> 01:40:53.042
Out of 25 villages,

1096
01:40:54.167 --> 01:40:55.583
only one remains.

1097
01:40:56.750 --> 01:40:59.125
If we sign these papers,

1098
01:40:59.625 --> 01:41:02.625
our name and identity
will be erased from this land.

1099
01:41:03.042 --> 01:41:04.250
That is why all my brothers

1100
01:41:04.417 --> 01:41:07.125
are sending you their severed thumbs.

1101
01:41:12.667 --> 01:41:13.708
Brother!

1102
01:41:37.917 --> 01:41:40.708
If you don't help us within 24 hours,

1103
01:41:41.750 --> 01:41:43.750
instead of our severed thumbs,

1104
01:41:45.167 --> 01:41:47.417
you'll be receiving our severed heads.

1105
01:41:47.917 --> 01:41:50.208
Will you kill yourself, brother?

1106
01:41:51.208 --> 01:41:53.000
The village must live.

1107
01:41:55.792 --> 01:41:58.333
Our pain won't be understood
just by writing about it.

1108
01:41:59.500 --> 01:42:01.833
People will only know
when they see the pain.

1109
01:42:09.083 --> 01:42:10.875
This is more precious than our very lives!

1110
01:42:12.458 --> 01:42:13.792
Take this carefully with you.

1111
01:42:14.917 --> 01:42:16.917
How long will it take to get there?

1112
01:42:17.042 --> 01:42:19.833
Don't worry.
Deliveries these days happen within a day.

1113
01:42:19.917 --> 01:42:22.833
- You all take care of yourselves.
- Thank you.

1114
01:42:24.250 --> 01:42:25.417
Let's go.

1115
01:44:46.375 --> 01:44:47.708
This is why people say

1116
01:44:48.750 --> 01:44:51.333
not to stick your fingers
where they don't belong.

1117
01:44:52.000 --> 01:44:53.000
Do what you must.

1118
01:44:54.042 --> 01:44:55.208
We have already done

1119
01:44:56.167 --> 01:44:57.167
what we needed to do.

1120
01:45:02.042 --> 01:45:04.125
Send your fingers
to whomever you want!

1121
01:45:04.250 --> 01:45:08.167
What I am about to do tomorrow,
no one will be able to stop it!

1122
01:45:21.375 --> 01:45:24.958
Sir, we women put on brave faces
and went to arrest Ranatunga.

1123
01:45:26.875 --> 01:45:30.042
No man from our station came with us.

1124
01:45:32.250 --> 01:45:35.750
Later, we discovered that all those men
were Ranatunga's henchmen.

1125
01:45:37.583 --> 01:45:40.667
We went there to shed light on the truth,

1126
01:45:41.375 --> 01:45:43.750
but we only found pitch darkness.

1127
01:45:47.917 --> 01:45:49.333
In that darkness,

1128
01:45:50.417 --> 01:45:55.208
we don't know how many hands
were laid on us.

1129
01:46:16.292 --> 01:46:17.292
Son…

1130
01:46:19.125 --> 01:46:20.542
The soldiers at the border

1131
01:46:21.292 --> 01:46:24.542
shed blood for every inch of our homeland.

1132
01:46:25.208 --> 01:46:26.250
But inside this nation,

1133
01:46:27.042 --> 01:46:28.708
some thug sheds the blood of our children

1134
01:46:29.500 --> 01:46:33.958
and snatches away our land and homes.

1135
01:46:35.375 --> 01:46:36.958
No one is here to listen to our pain,

1136
01:46:38.333 --> 01:46:40.958
and no one is here to fight for us.

1137
01:46:45.500 --> 01:46:46.500
<i>Amma.</i>

1138
01:46:48.125 --> 01:46:49.250
I'm a farmer.

1139
01:46:50.708 --> 01:46:51.708
I'm a Jaat.

1140
01:46:53.708 --> 01:46:55.708
Our relationship is not one of blood…

1141
01:46:59.833 --> 01:47:01.000
But of this soil.

1142
01:47:04.750 --> 01:47:05.750
This soil…

1143
01:47:07.500 --> 01:47:08.750
Is our mother.

1144
01:47:10.875 --> 01:47:14.292
From our first breath to our last,
it takes care of us.

1145
01:47:16.750 --> 01:47:18.000
As long as I'm alive…

1146
01:47:19.792 --> 01:47:22.875
I won't let one mother
be separated from another.

1147
01:47:25.667 --> 01:47:27.958
I cannot bring the dead back to life,

1148
01:47:29.625 --> 01:47:31.125
but I promise you this…

1149
01:47:32.208 --> 01:47:33.875
I will avenge their deaths.

1150
01:47:36.000 --> 01:47:39.333
I will kill Ranatunga!

1151
01:47:53.000 --> 01:47:54.000
Take this!

1152
01:47:57.458 --> 01:47:59.083
TRUTH ALONE TRIUMPHS

1153
01:48:20.333 --> 01:48:21.333
Sir…

1154
01:48:24.875 --> 01:48:25.875
Sir!

1155
01:48:26.958 --> 01:48:28.250
I want to file a complaint.

1156
01:48:28.417 --> 01:48:29.417
Go there.

1157
01:48:38.417 --> 01:48:39.833
I want to file a complaint.

1158
01:48:46.500 --> 01:48:47.792
Write it yourself.

1159
01:48:50.500 --> 01:48:52.083
It's your job.

1160
01:48:58.417 --> 01:48:59.417
Sit down.

1161
01:49:04.500 --> 01:49:05.500
Tell me.

1162
01:49:05.875 --> 01:49:07.083
I was eating <i>idlis.</i>

1163
01:49:08.583 --> 01:49:09.958
Someone shoved me.

1164
01:49:10.833 --> 01:49:11.833
The <i>idli</i> fell.

1165
01:49:12.417 --> 01:49:14.250
I told him to say sorry.

1166
01:49:14.708 --> 01:49:15.833
He didn't apologize.

1167
01:49:16.917 --> 01:49:18.250
I beat him to a pulp.

1168
01:49:19.167 --> 01:49:22.417
He then mentioned Ram Subba Reddy.

1169
01:49:23.958 --> 01:49:25.708
I went to Ram Subba Reddy.

1170
01:49:26.750 --> 01:49:29.083
I told him to say sorry.

1171
01:49:30.083 --> 01:49:31.625
He also didn't apologize.

1172
01:49:33.000 --> 01:49:34.292
I then beat him to a pulp.

1173
01:49:35.208 --> 01:49:36.208
He…

1174
01:49:37.000 --> 01:49:38.417
Mentioned Somulu.

1175
01:49:45.625 --> 01:49:46.833
So I went to him.

1176
01:49:47.875 --> 01:49:49.250
I told him to say sorry.

1177
01:49:50.000 --> 01:49:51.292
He also didn't apologize.

1178
01:49:52.167 --> 01:49:53.625
I then beat him to a pulp.

1179
01:49:55.000 --> 01:49:56.583
- Who did you thrash?
- Somulu!

1180
01:50:04.667 --> 01:50:05.667
Sit down.

1181
01:50:06.917 --> 01:50:10.625
He then mentioned his brother, Ranatunga.

1182
01:50:13.042 --> 01:50:15.125
Ranatunga apologized to me…

1183
01:50:16.792 --> 01:50:19.500
But I didn't feel satisfied.

1184
01:50:20.708 --> 01:50:24.250
I wrecked every one of his henchmen
right in front of him.

1185
01:50:26.917 --> 01:50:27.917
What is this?

1186
01:50:28.500 --> 01:50:29.667
Is this some kind of joke?

1187
01:50:30.458 --> 01:50:33.417
You're saying you beat everyone up,
and now you want to file a complaint?

1188
01:50:33.542 --> 01:50:34.875
This was just some information.

1189
01:50:36.792 --> 01:50:38.083
Now, write the complaint.

1190
01:50:39.083 --> 01:50:40.083
What's your complaint?

1191
01:50:42.292 --> 01:50:43.500
Vijaya Lakshmi!

1192
01:51:23.125 --> 01:51:25.542
You went there
with all that bravado to arrest him!

1193
01:51:26.500 --> 01:51:27.500
What happened?

1194
01:51:29.708 --> 01:51:33.083
Do you have any respect left,
or was that looted from you as well?

1195
01:51:35.833 --> 01:51:36.833
Sir!

1196
01:51:37.875 --> 01:51:40.500
An impotent man
who has lost all respect

1197
01:51:41.917 --> 01:51:44.500
does not have the authority
to comment on a woman's honor.

1198
01:51:46.083 --> 01:51:49.375
Your honor and respect
may be between your legs,

1199
01:51:50.417 --> 01:51:52.792
but our honor and respect…

1200
01:51:53.625 --> 01:51:55.792
Is judged by our conscience.

1201
01:51:56.208 --> 01:51:58.500
A man showed up to support you,

1202
01:51:58.667 --> 01:52:00.417
and suddenly your masculinity kicked in?

1203
01:52:01.000 --> 01:52:02.000
Hey!

1204
01:52:08.042 --> 01:52:09.042
Hey!

1205
01:52:12.042 --> 01:52:14.958
Don't you feel ashamed
making fun of women?

1206
01:52:16.625 --> 01:52:21.333
Write "Respect Women" in your hearts,
not just on your walls.

1207
01:52:21.833 --> 01:52:24.292
These women are like
your daughters and sisters.

1208
01:52:25.792 --> 01:52:28.167
They fulfilled their duties
as police officers.

1209
01:52:28.875 --> 01:52:31.333
And you, instead of helping them,

1210
01:52:32.042 --> 01:52:33.667
ran off like scaredy-cats?

1211
01:52:35.292 --> 01:52:39.917
People from 29 villages
were subjugated and killed.

1212
01:52:40.792 --> 01:52:42.792
What did you do as police officers?

1213
01:52:44.458 --> 01:52:46.708
Ten beheaded bodies were found.

1214
01:52:47.583 --> 01:52:49.417
The people were crying out for help!

1215
01:52:50.167 --> 01:52:52.292
What did you do as police officers?

1216
01:52:54.042 --> 01:52:58.208
A young girl was brave enough
to come forward with the truth,

1217
01:52:58.833 --> 01:53:01.208
but today she's lost her mind
and is eating dirt.

1218
01:53:02.708 --> 01:53:05.167
This is what you did as police officers.

1219
01:53:05.250 --> 01:53:06.458
Hey, hero!

1220
01:53:07.042 --> 01:53:08.458
Lower your voice!

1221
01:53:08.792 --> 01:53:10.583
This is my police station.

1222
01:53:15.292 --> 01:53:16.625
<i>Amma!</i>

1223
01:53:22.125 --> 01:53:24.417
You people are not worthy
of these uniforms!

1224
01:53:25.583 --> 01:53:28.958
These uniforms represent the strength,
belief, and trust of the people!

1225
01:53:29.625 --> 01:53:33.542
They gave you these uniforms
so you could protect them.

1226
01:53:34.167 --> 01:53:35.208
But instead…

1227
01:53:37.125 --> 01:53:38.625
You joined forces with the enemy

1228
01:53:39.167 --> 01:53:41.917
and abused the power that comes
with these uniforms!

1229
01:53:43.167 --> 01:53:44.750
Shut down this police station!

1230
01:53:45.292 --> 01:53:46.667
Take off your uniforms!

1231
01:53:47.375 --> 01:53:49.125
And surrender yourselves!

1232
01:54:03.167 --> 01:54:04.208
Tie this scoundrel up!

1233
01:54:10.208 --> 01:54:11.458
Sir!

1234
01:54:32.375 --> 01:54:34.500
Hey! Call Ranatunga!

1235
01:54:40.583 --> 01:54:41.583
Hello?

1236
01:54:42.625 --> 01:54:43.625
Sir!

1237
01:54:44.125 --> 01:54:46.708
The man who beat up your men
and destroyed things at your house

1238
01:54:46.833 --> 01:54:49.500
is now right here in my station.

1239
01:54:49.708 --> 01:54:51.029
Sir, please give us the go-ahead.

1240
01:54:51.083 --> 01:54:55.625
I'll shoot him and bring his body
to your doorstep.

1241
01:54:55.792 --> 01:54:56.792
No!

1242
01:54:57.625 --> 01:54:58.917
Keep him alive!

1243
01:54:59.667 --> 01:55:01.750
I'll be the one to kill him!

1244
01:55:02.292 --> 01:55:03.375
I'll come right away!

1245
01:55:03.458 --> 01:55:04.458
Please come, sir.

1246
01:55:05.042 --> 01:55:06.042
Please come.

1247
01:55:08.875 --> 01:55:09.875
Somu!

1248
01:55:10.250 --> 01:55:11.570
Where are you going at this hour?

1249
01:55:12.208 --> 01:55:13.750
To restore the honor of our household!

1250
01:55:14.708 --> 01:55:16.000
Let <i>Anna</i> know.

1251
01:55:22.708 --> 01:55:23.708
Hey!

1252
01:55:25.208 --> 01:55:26.208
Where is he?

1253
01:55:29.833 --> 01:55:31.417
Sir, please come. Welcome!

1254
01:55:32.083 --> 01:55:33.417
- Where is he?
- He's sitting there.

1255
01:55:41.208 --> 01:55:42.208
Who hit him?

1256
01:55:42.333 --> 01:55:43.333
I hit him, sir.

1257
01:55:43.667 --> 01:55:45.583
I can also kill him if you order me to.

1258
01:55:49.250 --> 01:55:51.792
No hitting without my permission.

1259
01:55:52.458 --> 01:55:53.625
It's personal.

1260
01:55:54.208 --> 01:55:55.792
- It's what?
- Personal.

1261
01:55:56.667 --> 01:55:57.667
Get lost!

1262
01:56:01.667 --> 01:56:02.708
Crack Man!

1263
01:56:03.667 --> 01:56:06.083
Do you know why
<i>Anna</i> spared your life?

1264
01:56:06.958 --> 01:56:09.500
So that I could be
the one to kill you!

1265
01:56:10.375 --> 01:56:11.958
Love you, <i>Anna!</i>

1266
01:56:33.292 --> 01:56:34.292
Hey!

1267
01:56:35.000 --> 01:56:36.000
Give me the bike keys!

1268
01:56:37.958 --> 01:56:39.042
Give me the bike keys!

1269
01:56:47.500 --> 01:56:48.500
Who are you?

1270
01:56:50.000 --> 01:56:51.000
Are you a gangster?

1271
01:56:53.083 --> 01:56:54.333
A Naxalite?

1272
01:56:56.042 --> 01:56:57.042
A terrorist?

1273
01:57:01.083 --> 01:57:02.083
Crack Man!

1274
01:57:02.625 --> 01:57:04.625
I'll slice you into so many pieces

1275
01:57:04.750 --> 01:57:07.750
it'll take a week
to clean up this police station.

1276
01:57:08.500 --> 01:57:13.000
I'll behead you
and put your head on my rooftop.

1277
01:57:21.500 --> 01:57:23.458
<i>102, come in!</i>

1278
01:57:23.625 --> 01:57:25.292
<i>Emergency! 102, come in!</i>

1279
01:57:25.458 --> 01:57:27.375
<i>102, come in!</i>

1280
01:57:27.542 --> 01:57:29.917
<i>102, come in! Emergency!</i>

1281
01:57:30.667 --> 01:57:32.583
102 speaking, respond.

1282
01:57:32.958 --> 01:57:34.458
The guy getting beaten in the station

1283
01:57:34.750 --> 01:57:36.417
isn't just some ordinary man!

1284
01:57:37.125 --> 01:57:40.333
<i>Tell the CI not to harm him!
Don't harm him!</i>

1285
01:57:40.417 --> 01:57:43.750
- Come again!
- Enough with this nonsense! Wake him up!

1286
01:57:43.833 --> 01:57:46.458
Don't wake him up, sir!

1287
01:57:51.042 --> 01:57:55.500
If he wakes up, he'll destroy all of you!

1288
01:57:55.583 --> 01:57:59.083
He'll definitely be alive.

1289
01:57:59.250 --> 01:58:01.375
I caught him two days ago
in a smuggling case.

1290
01:58:01.458 --> 01:58:05.708
Sir, he has a back story that only I know.
Should I tell you?

1291
01:58:05.833 --> 01:58:08.042
Hey, do you know him?

1292
01:58:08.208 --> 01:58:11.542
Dhaka Central Jail…

1293
01:58:12.167 --> 01:58:14.500
That prison held a dangerous gang.

1294
01:58:14.792 --> 01:58:18.750
Each member had killed
at least eight to ten people.

1295
01:58:18.875 --> 01:58:21.667
They were animals!
Every last one of them!

1296
01:58:21.917 --> 01:58:24.000
Salute them with one hand

1297
01:58:24.292 --> 01:58:26.250
and cover your back with the other.

1298
01:58:26.625 --> 01:58:30.292
That's how terrifying the gang was.
A dangerous gang!

1299
01:58:30.375 --> 01:58:32.458
But one day,

1300
01:58:32.792 --> 01:58:34.792
this hero was brought into our prison.

1301
01:58:38.000 --> 01:58:39.250
Fresh entry.

1302
01:58:43.792 --> 01:58:45.042
The gang thought

1303
01:58:45.500 --> 01:58:47.833
he was just another harmless guy.

1304
01:58:50.292 --> 01:58:52.750
That was their biggest mistake!

1305
01:59:01.333 --> 01:59:02.542
Hello, sir!

1306
01:59:02.958 --> 01:59:07.917
I've seen all kinds of fights,
struggles, and bloodshed,

1307
01:59:08.792 --> 01:59:13.833
but that day in the jail, this hero fought
like nothing I'd ever seen before…

1308
01:59:19.125 --> 01:59:20.458
<i>For the first time in my life,</i>

1309
01:59:20.750 --> 01:59:22.958
I witnessed such intense live action!

1310
01:59:29.792 --> 01:59:31.167
If he's alive…

1311
01:59:33.667 --> 01:59:37.333
Get ready for a repeat telecast
of that same dangerous fight!

1312
01:59:40.500 --> 01:59:44.500
He's a one-man wrecking crew
who breaks bones like it's nothing!

1313
01:59:47.917 --> 01:59:52.458
Don't make the same mistake
that the gang made.

1314
01:59:52.917 --> 01:59:56.417
This guy isn't made of normal atoms…

1315
01:59:59.375 --> 02:00:01.458
He's an atom bomb!

1316
02:00:05.208 --> 02:00:08.167
The whole prison used to fondly call him…

1317
02:00:15.833 --> 02:00:18.625
"The Bulldozer!"

1318
02:00:27.792 --> 02:00:31.208
If he's "The Bulldozer,"
then I'm a Battle Tank!

1319
02:00:33.042 --> 02:00:34.042
Wait and see!

1320
02:00:37.958 --> 02:00:38.958
Go look.

1321
02:00:39.708 --> 02:00:40.708
Go look!

1322
02:01:06.417 --> 02:01:10.000
I warned you, didn't I? He's alive, sir!

1323
02:01:10.625 --> 02:01:11.750
Is everyone here?

1324
02:01:13.583 --> 02:01:15.083
Did Ranatunga show up too?

1325
02:01:33.750 --> 02:01:37.875
This is who we call "The Bulldozer!"

1326
02:02:46.458 --> 02:02:48.167
Hey!

1327
02:02:49.833 --> 02:02:50.833
Move!

1328
02:03:39.750 --> 02:03:40.792
Vijaya Lakshmi!

1329
02:03:46.458 --> 02:03:47.458
Ayesha!

1330
02:06:04.708 --> 02:06:05.708
Thank you, sir.

1331
02:06:06.000 --> 02:06:07.000
Thank you.

1332
02:06:09.167 --> 02:06:12.333
- Where is the armory?
- It's over there.

1333
02:07:19.417 --> 02:07:20.792
Sir!

1334
02:07:23.208 --> 02:07:25.333
Do you know him?

1335
02:07:26.417 --> 02:07:29.583
Good thing you arrived late.

1336
02:07:30.667 --> 02:07:34.333
Otherwise, the 30 hanging bodies
would've become 31.

1337
02:07:35.500 --> 02:07:36.500
Phone…

1338
02:07:36.875 --> 02:07:38.125
Your phone is ringing.

1339
02:07:40.667 --> 02:07:43.875
You've been killing people
without mercy for years.

1340
02:07:45.625 --> 02:07:47.667
You should now feel their pain…

1341
02:07:49.000 --> 02:07:50.833
As you watch your brothers hanging.

1342
02:07:52.750 --> 02:07:55.000
Don't bother trying to find me.

1343
02:07:56.750 --> 02:07:59.125
I'm coming to finish you off!

1344
02:08:01.042 --> 02:08:02.042
Who was that?

1345
02:08:03.708 --> 02:08:05.000
The Bulldozer, right?

1346
02:08:05.792 --> 02:08:06.792
What did he say?

1347
02:08:06.958 --> 02:08:07.958
Is he calling you?

1348
02:08:08.375 --> 02:08:09.958
Sir, don't dare go to him,

1349
02:08:10.375 --> 02:08:12.125
or you'll be hanged too!

1350
02:08:13.208 --> 02:08:14.542
For real!

1351
02:08:43.875 --> 02:08:44.750
Yes.

1352
02:08:44.833 --> 02:08:49.333
Sir, there are no Indian records
on the person in the photo you sent.

1353
02:08:49.833 --> 02:08:54.125
However, our facial scanner found
a match with an international criminal.

1354
02:08:54.208 --> 02:08:55.208
And that is?

1355
02:08:55.292 --> 02:08:57.375
He's none other than Muthuvel Karikalan.

1356
02:08:57.458 --> 02:08:58.458
What?!

1357
02:09:04.542 --> 02:09:06.125
Tell me in detail! Details!

1358
02:09:06.375 --> 02:09:08.250
He is <i>the</i> Muthuvel Karikalan.

1359
02:09:08.542 --> 02:09:10.875
Deputy Commander
of the Jaffna Tiger Force.

1360
02:09:19.542 --> 02:09:23.667
The mastermind behind
the ex-Union Minister's assassination.

1361
02:09:23.875 --> 02:09:26.708
<i>However, due to his
anti-organizational activities,</i>

1362
02:09:26.833 --> 02:09:29.250
<i>he was expelled
from the Jaffna Tiger Force.</i>

1363
02:09:29.542 --> 02:09:31.333
<i>He's been absconding ever since.</i>

1364
02:09:31.542 --> 02:09:33.792
He's not a regular terrorist, sir.

1365
02:09:41.458 --> 02:09:42.958
He's very dangerous, sir.

1366
02:09:46.042 --> 02:09:47.625
I'm sending his details right away.

1367
02:09:47.750 --> 02:09:48.792
Make it fast!

1368
02:09:49.167 --> 02:09:50.167
Sir.

1369
02:09:50.917 --> 02:09:51.917
Let's go to Motupalli.

1370
02:09:53.250 --> 02:09:55.250
You've all lost a lot already.

1371
02:09:56.417 --> 02:09:59.333
I don't want to burden you any further.

1372
02:10:00.417 --> 02:10:02.000
You might have started the war.

1373
02:10:03.708 --> 02:10:04.917
But I'll be the one to end it.

1374
02:10:05.292 --> 02:10:07.917
Sir, you defended our dignity.

1375
02:10:08.958 --> 02:10:11.583
You're going to the ends of the earth

1376
02:10:12.500 --> 02:10:14.375
to protect a village
you have no connection to.

1377
02:10:16.125 --> 02:10:17.250
Who exactly are you, sir?

1378
02:10:22.000 --> 02:10:23.708
Someone who risks his life…

1379
02:10:25.542 --> 02:10:27.125
Even while knowing how precious it is.

1380
02:10:36.000 --> 02:10:38.042
Hello, CBI Satya Murthy here.

1381
02:10:39.083 --> 02:10:40.083
Okay, sir.

1382
02:10:40.167 --> 02:10:41.847
Forwarding the call
to my superior officer.

1383
02:10:41.958 --> 02:10:42.958
Fast!

1384
02:10:43.250 --> 02:10:45.011
CBI Satya Murthy
is on the line for you, sir.

1385
02:10:47.625 --> 02:10:49.000
Yes, Mr. Satya Murthy?

1386
02:10:49.208 --> 02:10:51.667
<i>Officer, I have direct orders
from the President.</i>

1387
02:10:51.833 --> 02:10:53.583
We're after a high-value terrorist,

1388
02:10:53.792 --> 02:10:55.309
and I require the Special Forces
for the operation.

1389
02:10:55.333 --> 02:10:56.500
<i>I'm currently at Motupalli.</i>

1390
02:11:00.333 --> 02:11:01.654
You're in a very remote location.

1391
02:11:01.708 --> 02:11:04.625
It'll take at least three hours
for the nearest unit to reach you.

1392
02:11:04.708 --> 02:11:07.833
I can't wait that long.
He must be caught immediately.

1393
02:11:08.458 --> 02:11:10.417
If not, we'll lose one person every hour.

1394
02:11:16.083 --> 02:11:18.875
Mr. Murthy, there's an officer
active in that area.

1395
02:11:18.958 --> 02:11:20.000
I can send him to you.

1396
02:11:20.292 --> 02:11:21.292
One officer?

1397
02:11:22.000 --> 02:11:24.875
The man I'm after
isn't some petty thug or robber.

1398
02:11:25.167 --> 02:11:29.500
I need a battalion to take him down,
not just one officer.

1399
02:11:29.833 --> 02:11:32.375
You need a battalion to start a war.

1400
02:11:32.542 --> 02:11:34.542
But to stop that war, trust me,

1401
02:11:35.625 --> 02:11:36.667
he alone is enough.

1402
02:11:39.417 --> 02:11:40.417
Who is he?

1403
02:11:40.625 --> 02:11:42.143
Whether it was the Kargil War in 1999,

1404
02:11:42.167 --> 02:11:44.542
the Surgical Strikes in 2016, or Balakot,

1405
02:11:50.333 --> 02:11:52.333
every time, he struck fear
into the enemy's heart.

1406
02:11:53.250 --> 02:11:54.583
He's a nightmare for Pakistan.

1407
02:12:00.667 --> 02:12:01.867
Whether it was Operation Vijay

1408
02:12:02.417 --> 02:12:04.708
or the Bangladesh Dhaka jail
undercover operation,

1409
02:12:05.750 --> 02:12:07.271
<i>the nation has changed over the years,</i>

1410
02:12:09.250 --> 02:12:10.583
<i>but his battles haven't.</i>

1411
02:12:10.875 --> 02:12:12.583
He can forgive his enemies,

1412
02:12:13.250 --> 02:12:17.625
but when it comes
to the nation's enemies, he's ruthless.

1413
02:12:22.292 --> 02:12:24.042
He doesn't just fight with weapons.

1414
02:12:24.875 --> 02:12:26.958
He becomes the weapon.

1415
02:12:34.333 --> 02:12:37.292
The place you're referring to,
he's already there.

1416
02:12:39.667 --> 02:12:42.083
FISHERMEN'S COLONY

1417
02:12:43.167 --> 02:12:44.708
The guy getting beaten in the station

1418
02:12:45.000 --> 02:12:46.667
isn't just some ordinary man!

1419
02:12:46.792 --> 02:12:47.875
He's a lion!

1420
02:12:54.583 --> 02:12:56.458
He's the Lion of the Jat Regiment!

1421
02:12:58.583 --> 02:13:01.292
One of our best commandos
and the pride of the Indian Army.

1422
02:13:03.833 --> 02:13:05.708
Brigadier Baldev Pratap Singh!

1423
02:13:28.167 --> 02:13:29.167
It's getting late.

1424
02:13:29.625 --> 02:13:31.125
Where are the Motupalli documents?

1425
02:13:32.333 --> 02:13:33.500
Where is Ranatunga?

1426
02:13:42.917 --> 02:13:43.917
He's here.

1427
02:14:14.125 --> 02:14:15.333
<i>Amma!</i>

1428
02:14:22.208 --> 02:14:24.042
How far have you studied, child?

1429
02:14:26.167 --> 02:14:28.708
Enough to write a letter
to the President, right?

1430
02:14:33.500 --> 02:14:34.500
Take this.

1431
02:14:35.125 --> 02:14:36.542
Write another letter.

1432
02:14:38.292 --> 02:14:39.292
Now!

1433
02:14:40.792 --> 02:14:43.625
"To the Honorable President,"

1434
02:14:45.458 --> 02:14:49.375
we, the villagers of Motupalli,

1435
02:14:49.958 --> 02:14:54.208
are writing this letter to tell you

1436
02:14:55.125 --> 02:14:58.458
"how we perished at the hands
of the great Ranatunga."

1437
02:15:01.625 --> 02:15:03.875
"The first bullet went
straight to the chest."

1438
02:15:08.083 --> 02:15:11.542
"The second bullet
went right through the throat."

1439
02:15:16.625 --> 02:15:19.292
"And the third claimed three corpses."

1440
02:15:21.875 --> 02:15:23.292
"Three old folks fell dead."

1441
02:15:25.500 --> 02:15:27.042
Go on, write!

1442
02:15:31.042 --> 02:15:32.625
Write, I say!

1443
02:15:34.500 --> 02:15:39.542
"He's coming to put an end
to all of your atrocities." Write it down!

1444
02:15:41.500 --> 02:15:44.833
"The land he killed for

1445
02:15:44.917 --> 02:15:48.833
will be the very land
that buries him in the storm."

1446
02:15:49.125 --> 02:15:50.333
Write this as well.

1447
02:15:53.458 --> 02:15:57.125
"The very hands whose thumbs you cut off

1448
02:15:58.417 --> 02:16:01.083
will now hang you to death!"

1449
02:16:11.625 --> 02:16:14.500
I can already hear…

1450
02:16:14.792 --> 02:16:16.458
You pleading for your life.

1451
02:16:23.958 --> 02:16:25.875
I might be dying,

1452
02:16:26.083 --> 02:16:28.208
but I will surely witness

1453
02:16:28.542 --> 02:16:34.500
the… end… of you.

1454
02:17:48.875 --> 02:17:49.875
Sir, let's go.

1455
02:17:52.417 --> 02:17:53.417
Where are you going?

1456
02:17:54.167 --> 02:17:57.208
He has a rocket launcher! Run!

1457
02:19:42.083 --> 02:19:43.083
Hey!

1458
02:19:43.458 --> 02:19:44.542
Throw away the gun!

1459
02:19:45.375 --> 02:19:46.625
Or else I'll kill her!

1460
02:19:49.583 --> 02:19:50.458
Put the gun down!

1461
02:19:50.583 --> 02:19:51.783
Let her go!
She's just a child!

1462
02:20:11.250 --> 02:20:15.083
I've killed more soldiers than civilians.

1463
02:20:17.333 --> 02:20:19.292
Before I leave this country,

1464
02:20:20.333 --> 02:20:23.750
an army man will be my last kill.

1465
02:22:02.833 --> 02:22:06.708
It took me 15 years to build my empire.

1466
02:22:08.417 --> 02:22:10.667
But you? You razed it down in ten hours!

1467
02:22:13.375 --> 02:22:15.000
You murdered my brothers.

1468
02:22:16.625 --> 02:22:18.333
Where did you get that kind of guts?

1469
02:22:19.000 --> 02:22:21.375
I'm a Jaat, made from this very soil.

1470
02:22:23.375 --> 02:22:26.292
A selfless person
who puts his people first.

1471
02:22:27.875 --> 02:22:30.375
A warrior who'll stand up
against millions.

1472
02:22:31.958 --> 02:22:35.667
A man who protects his mother,
family, and his children.

1473
02:22:37.917 --> 02:22:41.000
And when a Jaat
becomes an army officer,

1474
02:22:42.750 --> 02:22:46.625
he swells with pride at being an Indian.

1475
02:23:35.458 --> 02:23:36.458
Hey!

1476
02:24:09.000 --> 02:24:11.250
God only appears when called.

1477
02:24:12.375 --> 02:24:14.083
He provides only when asked.

1478
02:24:15.583 --> 02:24:19.333
But he gave us everything
without us having to ask.

1479
02:24:20.083 --> 02:24:22.167
To us, he is our God.

1480
02:24:25.500 --> 02:24:29.500
People like you make the nation
glow with pride and strength.

1481
02:24:30.542 --> 02:24:33.958
The country is proud of you,
Brigadier Baldev Pratap Singh!

1482
02:24:43.625 --> 02:24:45.167
Uncle!

1483
02:24:59.250 --> 02:25:00.417
Please come here.

1484
02:25:12.625 --> 02:25:15.583
Uncle, aren't you the President?

1485
02:25:15.833 --> 02:25:18.750
You came to our rescue
after reading my letter, right?

1486
02:25:18.833 --> 02:25:19.875
Thank you, Uncle!

1487
02:25:20.875 --> 02:25:24.917
If we're ever in trouble again,
we'll definitely count on you.

1488
02:25:25.375 --> 02:25:26.695
You'll come to our rescue, right?

1489
02:25:27.917 --> 02:25:28.917
Of course, dear.

1490
02:25:33.292 --> 02:25:34.375
I most certainly will.

1491
02:25:39.750 --> 02:25:43.083
Madam President, this is Satya Murthy
reporting from Motupalli.

1492
02:25:43.333 --> 02:25:44.458
Tell me, Satya Murthy.

1493
02:25:44.542 --> 02:25:45.708
I was waiting for your call.

1494
02:25:45.958 --> 02:25:47.125
There was a war.

1495
02:25:47.292 --> 02:25:48.875
A war? Who started it?

1496
02:25:49.292 --> 02:25:52.125
A farmer who lives for this very land.

1497
02:25:52.500 --> 02:25:55.417
A soldier who pledged his life
to our country.

1498
02:25:56.583 --> 02:25:59.667
He led the war and brought about justice.

1499
02:26:00.208 --> 02:26:01.083
Who is he?

1500
02:26:01.167 --> 02:26:02.375
He's none other than

1501
02:26:02.833 --> 02:26:04.625
Brigadier Baldev Pratap Singh!

1502
02:26:04.833 --> 02:26:05.833
Jat Regiment.

1503
02:26:30.250 --> 02:26:31.333
<i>Your Jaat!</i>

1504
02:26:40.542 --> 02:26:45.167
<i>The Jaats, jewels of the land</i>

1505
02:26:45.417 --> 02:26:50.333
<i>We break all barriers with our hands</i>

1506
02:26:51.167 --> 02:26:56.042
<i>Step back, the Jaat moves ahead</i>

1507
02:26:56.125 --> 02:27:01.250
<i>With strength and spirit
We rise instead</i>
